{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">呂慧儀一向視兒子「蟹籽」黃柏翹為心肝寶貝，更常陪伴在側，是圈中公認的模範媽媽。近日「蟹籽」正式小學畢業，呂慧儀在社交網分享溫馨片段，並感觸寫下：「小學畢業不是一個終點，而是另外一個起點。繼續努力成長，My little man，我開心見到你開心，繼續享受校園的時光。時間過得有點快喔，能不能稍稍慢那麼一點點？捨不得你長大。」母子二人頭貼頭合照，場面溫馨爆燈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b128116a-26f6-4b6b-8a45-d342c35aa106.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026owddYsV5q61783912826.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b128116a-26f6-4b6b-8a45-d342c35aa106.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"de406486-d79a-4b0d-9b57-f24dd80126e2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026gOMR6fSKeK1783912831.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"de406486-d79a-4b0d-9b57-f24dd80126e2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_df6ea4382b948cf4-583\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">呂慧儀對「蟹籽」的教育路向早有深思熟慮。兒子原本就讀於屯門區唯一的直資小學「保良局香港道教聯合會圓玄小學」。該校以英語為主要教學語言，並輔以普通話教中文，成功為「蟹籽」打下了優良的兩文三語根基。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_df6ea4382b948cf4-584\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">為了免卻兒子面對升中呈分試、自行分配學位面試及統一派位「大抽獎」等重重壓力，呂慧儀早在「蟹籽」小五時，已作出精明抉擇，將他轉校至一間提供「一條龍」IB（國際文憑）課程的學校。因此，今次「蟹籽」小學畢業，亦無需擔心升中派位問題，將會直接原校升讀中學。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T01:04:45.893174+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":402,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}